    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d278">

                <pb facs="0263" n="251" sameAs="frus:frus1942v04/pg251"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">891.20/170: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in Iran</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Dreyfus</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Tehran</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1942-09-03T13:00:00+03:25">September 3,
                            1942—1 p.m.</date>
                        <lb/> [Received September 3—11:15 a.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>282. Prime Minister informed me today that he is anxious to obtain the military
                    mission as soon as possible. He asked me to inquire of Department concerning
                    progress being made in this regard.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Dreyfus</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
